{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"Returns a component inventory of one local file plus optional CycloneDX-1.6 and SPDX-2.3-shaped documents, inline. Each component has name, version|null, type (library/application/module), source (go-buildinfo, cargo-auditable, binary-classifier), purl|null, evidence_kind (derived|inferred) and bounded file locations. Sources: Go build info, Rust cargo-auditable metadata, and a BinSight banner-signature table (OpenSSL, zlib, SQLite, libcurl, Node.js, BusyBox, Chrome). completeness is ALWAYS \"partial\": an absent source is not proof a component is absent, and static/vendored code may carry no recorded identity. Read once without executing the target, with no network, registry or vulnerability-DB access, and nothing is written; SBOM timestamps are fixed so identical bytes give identical output. Versions and purls are reported as observed, not validated. Guards: 256 MiB input, 8 MiB output, 128 MiB scan window, 4096-match and 20000-component caps with coverage/truncation flags. Unknowns stay explicit: null versions/purls and a per-source limitation naming why a source yielded nothing.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"examples":[{"path":"/artifacts/application"},{"format":"cyclonedx","path":"/artifacts/application"}],"properties":{"format":{"default":"both","description":"Which SBOM document(s) to render inline alongside the normalized list","enum":["both","cyclonedx","spdx"],"type":"string"},"path":{"description":"Absolute filesystem path to the selected local file","minLength":1,"pattern":"^[^\\x00]*$","type":"string"}},"required":["path"],"type":"object"},"name":"generate_sbom","outputSchema":{"$defs":{"__schema0":{"pattern":"^ev_[a-f0-9]{64}$","type":"string"},"__schema1":{"anyOf":[{"oneOf":[{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"architecture":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["x86","x8